Package: sonic-cli-filter
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         sonic-utilities-data
Description: SONiC CLI command filter
 Platform-specific CLI command filter that removes unwanted switch-oriented
 commands (VLAN, VXLAN, NAT, etc.) from the SONiC show/config/clear CLIs.
 .
 Uses the existing sonic-utilities plugin mechanism with a per-device JSON
 blacklist to prune commands after registration.
